  <item>
    <title>《半熟恋人5》嗑糖局：柳周、BKTT首谈恋爱日常</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6cc1d2b581962ce2beb051</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6cc1d2b581962ce2beb051</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 15:43:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>恋综总有新故事。</span></p><p><span>本周《半熟恋人5》迎来收官。“柳周”（徐绿杨X周佑凌）从犹豫、争吵到逆袭成真、聊未来规划，被网友称为“恋综反转天花板”；“BKTT”（陆炳锟X王译）则全程稳定高甜，被称作“半熟恋爱范本”。</span></p><p><span>本期《今天听月亮》独家邀请到两对CP合体录制播客，透露节目中的幕后趣事，和节目之后的甜蜜日常。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FglzAZ4bqOssvxIrqKuxF6Hn1dG7.webp" alt="图片"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsyJCyvU_YCwOdyMeQZn326sQwhu.webp" alt="图片"><p><strong><span>/ 你将听到 /</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>柳周CP&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">00:01:29</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;已进入“没办法分开的时期”</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">00:06:59</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;最想“撤回”海南第一次吵架</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">00:16:49</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;心动瞬间：周佑凌的一见钟情</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">00:19:30</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;恋爱中谁更主动？</span></p><p><strong><span>BKTT（译陆有你）CP</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1774">00:29:34</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;异地不是问题，京沪高铁“坐得很流畅”</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2277">00:37:57</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;塔塔原本“不会接触00后”，是BK打破原则</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2652">00:44:12</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;恋爱中的BK：每周一束花、亲自下厨</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3075">00:51:15</a></span></strong><span>&nbsp;作为“半熟模板”，两人吵过架吗？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/626a813b965babfeed44afce/lhuiax-GcpJPx1dYTZajQ7Q3m7JA.m4a" length="57440292" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:11</itunes:duration>
