  <item>
    <title>83 对话｜脱口秀“打”到第二年，谁热播、谁涨粉、谁赚钱？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a45ca542cc2798e75accae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a45ca542cc2798e75accae</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 19 Aug 2025 11:23:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>写在前面：因本期录制偶有杂音干扰，主播提问有3处为事后补录，希望不影响大家的听感：）</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>/ 本期嘉宾 /</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>蚂蚱——自媒体「严肃喜剧」作者</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>/ 你将听到 /</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">00:01:38</a>再不聊，脱友和喜单热度就不行了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">00:08:40</a>脱友和喜单录制现场的不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="918">00:15:18</a>控场的庞博，鞠躬的郭麒麟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1043">00:17:23</a>抢新人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">00:24:33</a>老演员的游戏策略变了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">00:30:17</a>喜单的“三人组”，脱友的“大局观”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2276">00:37:56</a>女演员集中爆发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2579">00:42:59</a>赛制对选手很温柔，但观众很“受罪”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2771">00:46:11</a>演员们的涨粉情况</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2932">00:48:52</a>行业变化：票房大涨，千人专场更多了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3398">00:56:38</a>互动脱口秀的火爆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3753">01:02:33</a>脱口秀的尽头，是影视圈？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4049">01:07:29</a>更多老选手选择不上节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4395">01:13:15</a>线下厂牌过得更好了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4851">01:20:51</a>“单立人PK笑果”已不存在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5143">01:25:43</a>小块俱乐部赔的钱，多久能赚回来？</span></p>]]></description>
